-- Worked examples. The 12,000 monthly salary is a placeholder for the
-- salary table's third-year senior figure.
#ASSERT `the clause 5 hourly rate` `a 30-day outside substitute paid at the fixed rate` 12000 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `how the substitute is paid` `a 30-day outside substitute paid at the fixed rate` EQUALS `the fixed hourly rate of clause 5`
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the training increment` `a 30-day outside substitute paid at the fixed rate`
#ASSERT `vacation money at the end of the engagement` `a 30-day outside substitute paid at the fixed rate` 10000 EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `holiday pay` FALSE TRUE 3 5 EQUALS `employed by the hour until the holiday ends`
#ASSERT `entitled to full seniority` (`substitute year` 4 0.2 0 0 380 `an elementary school`)
#ASSERT `calendar days spanned` 51 5 EQUALS 71

#TRACE `calling a substitute` `an ordinary absence` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `invite a substitute` 4 AT 4
#TRACE `the organisation fee` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `require a declaration of union membership` AT 1
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `deduct the organisation fee` AT 2
#TRACE `no hourly pay beyond two months` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `employ on hourly pay` 3 AT 3
